    "text": "A PROCLAMATION BY HIS EXCELLENCY THE PRESIDENT",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      450.33,
      357.13,
      538.87,
      368.2
    ],
    "text": "MAITHRIPALA SIRISENA.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      397.09,
      539.01,
      432.16
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS, I am of the opinion that by reason of the existence of a public emergency in Sri Lanka, it is expedient, so to do, inthe interests of public security, the protection of public order and the maintenance of supplies and services essential to the lifeof the community ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      445.09,
      538.93,
      492.16
    ],
    "text": "Know ye that, I, Maithripala Sirisena, President , by virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 2 of the PublicSecurity Ordinance, as amended by Act, No. 8 of 1959, Law, No. 6 of 1978 and Act, No. 28 of 1988, do by this Proclamationdeclare that the provisions of Part II of that Ordinance, shall forthwith come into operation throughout Sri Lanka on the06th March, Two Thousand Eighteen.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      505.09,
      335.88,
      516.16
    ],
    "text": "Given at Colombo on the 06th March, Two Thousand Eighteen.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      541.09,
      416.08,
      552.16
    ],
    "text": "By His Excellency's Command,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
